    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/ea7621ae89a93123b6531961ea0fddc1.poster.avif?t=1749613412\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/ea7621ae89a93123b6531961ea0fddc1.webm?t=1749613412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/ea7621ae89a93123b6531961ea0fddc1.mp4?t=1749613412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find the laptop of a young girl from the early 2000s. Lily is your typical teenage girl\u00a0\u2014 dramatic, emotional, and has big dreams\u00a0\u2014 but she's hiding a secret. Reconnect with her old friends, read through her cringey blog, and solve puzzles that unlock parts of her past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While her computer seems ordinary at first, everything changes when someone realizes you aren't Lily...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/7f9b4d58658077ebdc5b15eeeccd7c29.poster.avif?t=1749613412\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/7f9b4d58658077ebdc5b15eeeccd7c29.webm?t=1749613412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/7f9b4d58658077ebdc5b15eeeccd7c29.mp4?t=1749613412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/045d45c7f56dae0d6f701cca82e5aba9.poster.avif?t=1749613412\" width=358 height=36 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/045d45c7f56dae0d6f701cca82e5aba9.webm?t=1749613412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early web is back. Relive the glory days of sparkly GIFs, AIM, and chain emails. XD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles that require you to explore Lily's world. Look through <i>everything</i>: her laptop files, social media, diary\u00a0\u2014 even your own computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic cringe. All in-game photos are taken from the developer\u2019s (or her friends\u2019) teenage selves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-rich story about growing up as a lonely nerd</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/ea7621ae89a93123b6531961ea0fddc1.poster.avif?t=1749613412\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/ea7621ae89a93123b6531961ea0fddc1.webm?t=1749613412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/ea7621ae89a93123b6531961ea0fddc1.mp4?t=1749613412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find the laptop of a young girl from the early 2000s. Lily is your typical teenage girl\u00a0\u2014 dramatic, emotional, and has big dreams\u00a0\u2014 but she's hiding a secret. Reconnect with her old friends, read through her cringey blog, and solve puzzles that unlock parts of her past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While her computer seems ordinary at first, everything changes when someone realizes you aren't Lily...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/7f9b4d58658077ebdc5b15eeeccd7c29.poster.avif?t=1749613412\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/7f9b4d58658077ebdc5b15eeeccd7c29.webm?t=1749613412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/7f9b4d58658077ebdc5b15eeeccd7c29.mp4?t=1749613412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/045d45c7f56dae0d6f701cca82e5aba9.poster.avif?t=1749613412\" width=358 height=36 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/045d45c7f56dae0d6f701cca82e5aba9.webm?t=1749613412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early web is back. Relive the glory days of sparkly GIFs, AIM, and chain emails. XD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles that require you to explore Lily's world. Look through <i>everything</i>: her laptop files, social media, diary\u00a0\u2014 even your own computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic cringe. All in-game photos are taken from the developer\u2019s (or her friends\u2019) teenage selves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-rich story about growing up as a lonely nerd</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "lily\u2019s world XD is a psychological horror game where you investigate a young girl\u2019s computer. Channel your inner 2000s teen as you read her old conversations, customize her blog, and look through her embarrassing selfies. That is, until you find messages addressed to you...",
